	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/markdown" rect="(80.0, 330.0, 460.0, 110.0)" font-family="Sans Serif" font-size="16">*Chapter 5, 5A. Bag of Words: Count / IDF / L2 (TF-IDF). Hierarchical Clustering: set Annotations to Category and drag the cut line. k-Means: try k = 2..5; color MDS by Cluster, then by Category.*</text>
